    <blockquote class="spull">&ldquo;It was only Saturday, and neither had anywhere they had to&nbsp;be.&rdquo;</blockquote>
    <div class="scol">
      <p>He felt her watching him and shifted his gaze back to the bed, narrowing his eyes in faux accusation. As he approached her, she began to giggle, unable to contain her delight, and he matched her laughter with a silly grin. Smitten, neither could believe their good fortune.</p>
      <p>Morning light spilled into the bedroom and the melody escaped out of the window and down to they city below. It was only Saturday, and neither had anywhere they had to be. They both knew they might linger there for hours, or the whole day, or two, dissolving into conversation, and pleasure, and one another, as naturally as cream into coffee.</p>
      <p class="sig">&mdash; [.t.b.c.</p>
    </div>
